{"title":"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Carlos Montado was born on Saturday, November 9, 2002. On what day of the week will Carlos be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/29510d1b84c95239a4fae1a0364f4303f01854af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$706$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> days old? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca53299d7480d72919a009f30a7b0f088268a512.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{Monday}\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ \\text{Wednesday}\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ \\text{Friday}\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ \\text{Saturday}\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ \\text{Sunday}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"590\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b640caf462417d59208b590f634dd8de89b8a96f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$700$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> days, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> weeks, it will be Saturday.  Thus after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/29510d1b84c95239a4fae1a0364f4303f01854af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$706$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> days, it will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days after Saturday, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbffe7e14c5d45b107253e492542757b50903e3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{Friday}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"94\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4cac61733f1edf8017c1087c2a6e566482c198.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$707$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> days, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bb6fb7a3ff722532798b45607025254679e7b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> weeks, it will be Saturday.  Thus after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/29510d1b84c95239a4fae1a0364f4303f01854af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$706$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> days, it will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> day before Saturday, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbffe7e14c5d45b107253e492542757b50903e3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{Friday}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"94\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ze0yDOAGL4Y\">https://youtu.be/ze0yDOAGL4Y</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wi